{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/extras/Description_Titre_TheDemo_EN.png?t=1750233747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo takes place on a <strong>small island</strong> \u2014 a playground for Bill \u2014 where you can try out the <strong>game's core mechanics</strong>: driving an <strong>RC car</strong>, training on the <strong>aerial course</strong>, a bit of <strong>exploration</strong>, and handing out a <strong>few slaps</strong> along the way. <br> <br>This is just a <strong>rough draft</strong> of the final game, which will feature a much <strong>larger island</strong> with more vehicles, bosses, challenges, environments, and more. <br> <br>The game supports controllers, but for better precision, mouse + keyboard remain your best allies. <br> <br><u>Your mission:</u> complete the <strong>10 objectives</strong> on the <strong>To-Do List</strong>. <br> <br>Good Luck!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814080?t=1750233747","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/6df488835ce6826a2bb7fcf2468694bbd9b275cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750233747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/a876e0961971aaede9fa9c9663dc5553d08ec637/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750233747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/a876e0961971aaede9fa9c9663dc5553d08ec637/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750233747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features some cartoon-style violence (fighting, blood), but the world itself is stylized and non-realistic, which keeps the overall tone light and playful rather than graphic or disturbing."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/extras/Description_Titre_TheDemo_EN.png?t=1750233747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo takes place on a <strong>small island</strong> \u2014 a playground for Bill \u2014 where you can try out the <strong>game's core mechanics</strong>: driving an <strong>RC car</strong>, training on the <strong>aerial course</strong>, a bit of <strong>exploration</strong>, and handing out a <strong>few slaps</strong> along the way. <br> <br>This is just a <strong>rough draft</strong> of the final game, which will feature a much <strong>larger island</strong> with more vehicles, bosses, challenges, environments, and more. <br> <br>The game supports controllers, but for better precision, mouse + keyboard remain your best allies. <br> <br><u>Your mission:</u> complete the <strong>10 objectives</strong> on the <strong>To-Do List</strong>. <br> <br>Good Luck!</p>","developers":["ARTPUNK STUDIO"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3710470","name":"RAGING BILL"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814080/c11931b53edcc4c61c554a7546ca5612c1d471a5/header.jpg?t=1750233747","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155481,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155481/movie480.mp4?t=1749802478","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com